    "updated_at": "2019-04-25T18:38:43Z",
    "body": "FWIW, prompted by https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=677733 I did a pass. Safari 12, Firefox 66, Edge 18 and Chrome 73 all throw on access to `sessionStorage` from an opaque origin. So yeah, let's fix the spec.\r\n\r\nGood first PR?",
